HermesLink authorship and AI-generated work
==========================================

Project-specific authorship and changes are recorded in the Git history.
Upstream components retain their own authorship, copyright notices, and
attribution as described in COPYING.

The HermesLink-specific integration code in this repository—including glue
code, Blink modifications, overlays, and build/test support—was generated with
AI assistance. This statement identifies how the project-specific material was
created; it does not replace or change any upstream copyright, license, or
attribution notices.
